title: "sk-llm-eval"
abstract: "A practical benchmark for Slovak language quality in LLM responses: grammar, register, Slovak facts, formatting per Slovak orthography and long-text consistency, with a blind judge and a leaderboard. Python standard library only, works with any OpenAI-compatible API."
